        "Content": "Entrance Hall\t6.17m x 1.45m\tTimber laminate flooring throughout. ample space under staircase for storage.\r\n\r\nGuest Bathroom\t1.52m x 1.26m\tTimber laminate flooring throughout, w.h.b with built in cabinetry underneath and tiled splashback and w.c.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\t5.14m x 3.30m\tTimber laminate flooring throughout, panel media wall, large window overlooking front garden and driveway, tv points and electrical points.\r\n\r\nLarge Kitchen/Dining Room\t5.55m x 4.76m\tTimber laminate flooring throughout, fully fitted kitchen with floor and eye level cabinetry, ample worktop space, double stainless-steel sink and drainer with tiled splashback under large window overlooking south westerly facing gardens, Combi microwave oven six sense, Whirlpool oven, integrated Whirlpool fridge freezer, integrated Belling dishwasher, Whirlpool induction hob under extractor fan. French doors leading out to south westerly facing gardens.\r\n\r\nDoor leading through to:\r\n\r\nUtility Room\t2.68m x 1.47m\tTimber laminate flooring, floor and eye level cabinetry, ample worktop space with stainless steel sink and drainer, tiled splashback, plumbed for washing machine and overhead open shelves.\r\n\r\nFrom Central Hallway, carpeted staircase leading to:\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n \t\t\r\nLanding Area\t4.61m x 2.29m\tCarpeted flooring throughout, hatch to attic overhead, large storage area with pressured Joule air to water heat pump system.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom\t3.58m x 3.15m\tCarpeted flooring throughout, large window overlooking front garden and driveway, built in Slide robes.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\t1.76m x 1.67m\tTimber laminate flooring, enclosed shower with rainwater shower head with tiled walls and corner glass door, w.h.b with tiled splashback, electrics for wall mounted mirror, w.c. and open floating shelves.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\t3.03m x 3.02m (max)\tTiled flooring throughout, part floor to ceiling tiling to all wet area, bath with separate shower including rains water shower head and glass enclosure, w.h.b with built in storage underneath and mirror and lighting overhead, w.c and wall mounted shelves.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\t4.49m x 3.10m\tCarpeted flooring throughout, feature wall panels, Slide robes, large window overlooking westerly garden.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\t3.22m x 2.46m\tTimber laminate flooring, treble bay slide robes, window overlooking rear garden.\r\n\r\nTotal Floor Area: c.122 sq.m / 1,313 sq.ft."
